            <ArticleTitle>Asthma treatment guidelines: how do we measure up?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>S422-6; quiz S427-33</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The use of clinical guidelines for the management of asthma can help improve patient outcomes and control costs. This article explores ways that managed care organizations can encourage physicians to follow guidelines more consistently to achieve better asthma management outcomes among their patients and reduce healthcare spending.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
